senses.gloss:
payasyā
(1) Cleome gynandra Linn. = Gynandropsis pentaphylla DC. (HB);
(2) = vidārīkanda (Cakra on Ca.Sū. 4, 9);
(3) = kṣīravidārī (Cakra on Ca. Ci. 11, 37; Ḍa. on Su.Ci. 17, 8);
(4) = kṣīrakākolī (Ḍa. on Su.Sū. 39, 8 and Ci. 16, 10; Cakra on Ca.Ci.
8, 79);
(5) = arkapuṣpī (Cakra on Ca.Ci. 29, 92, Ci. 30, 50 and Ka. 7, 19; Ḍa.
on Su.Ci. 20, 35 and Ka. 1, 61; Aruṇa on A.h.Ci. 22, 42);
(6) = dugdhikā = kṣīriṇī, names used for a wide variety of plants
(He. on A.h.Ci. 3, 95 and Ka. 4, 25).
